  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained high operational tempo and attrition of remotely piloted systems in the conflict forces militaries and prime contractors to field drones with higher on-board decision-making (route/target selection, collision avoidance) to maintain effectiveness, raising the average autonomy level of deployed models.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
