  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Rapid battlefield adoption and export of armed and dual‑use UAV capabilities in Ukraine triggers new U.S. export controls, stricter export licensing and allied technology screening aimed at China, increasing unpredictability of trade and tech rules between the U.S. and China.</data>
