  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Elevated strategic security concerns drive governments to expand export controls, national security reviews, and procurement restrictions on AI technologies, producing a measurable uptick in regulatory attention and enforcement actions.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_rivalry</data>
