  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising US–China security tensions pull US/Western operational focus and some high-end assets toward the Indo‑Pacific and induce more cautious or delayed Western force-projection and materiel flows to Europe, which Russia can exploit to increase conventional operations in Ukraine.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
