  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Escalating, unpredictable trade and technology regulations (export controls, blacklists, investment bans) raise sovereign and currency risk premia and prompt foreign holders to reduce duration exposure, pushing up long-term government bond yields.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d40">global_bond_stress</data>
</edge>
