  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising US–China regulatory uncertainty (export controls, sanctions on Chinese entities) incentivizes US authorities to expand secondary sanctions and compliance enforcement targeting China‑Iran trade networks, increasing overall sanctions pressure on Iranian-linked actors.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d40">us_iran_standoff</data>
