  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Escalating sanctions on Iran push Tehran to deepen military-technical sales and barter with partners (notably Russia) as revenue and leverage avenues, increasing transfers of armed/UAS systems that raise drone employment in the Ukraine theater.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
