  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Broader and tighter sanctions tied to the US–Iran standoff increase banking, insurance and logistics frictions for regional trade, producing knock-on interruptions and delays in international procurement and transport links that feed into supply chains connected to the Russia–Ukraine conflict.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_iran_standoff</data>
