  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">High-frequency or widely publicized AI safety incidents trigger rapid risk-off moves and concentrated selling in AI-exposed instruments, causing market-makers to widen spreads and reduce depth, thereby worsening liquidity.</data>
