  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A rise in AI safety incidents (misidentifications, unintended strikes, communication failures) produces immediate operational risk and loss of trust among commanders, prompting temporary grounding, stricter human-in-the-loop requirements, or reduced mission profiles for drone units.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
