  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">High-profile AI safety failures—especially involving surveillance, autonomy in critical infrastructure, or military-adjacent systems—produce mutual accusations, emergency policy responses, and force-posturing that raise perceived military and strategic risk between the US and China.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
