  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Intensified AI-related regulatory scrutiny in major supplier states spurs export controls, licensing bottlenecks, and tighter vetting of compute/hardware transfers, directly delaying deliveries of components and software used in military and commercial supply chains affecting the conflict zone.</data>
